Package: tflplanner
Type: Package
Title: Study Manager for Clinical Tables, Listings and Figures
Version: 0.0.2.9285
Authors@R: c(
    person(given  = "Yoichi",
           family = "Masui",
           email  = "ichi.r.pro@gmail.com",
           role   = c("aut", "cre", "cph")))
Description: Manages the clinical tables, listings and figures of a study
    in a 'shiny' application. Each study is a folder of its own: its input
    data, definitions, programs, results and the records of its official
    runs. The application defines the study's analysis results data (ARD)
    and writes one 'cards' / 'cardx' program per output, which together make
    the study's ARD; it defines the tables, listings and figures and writes
    one program per report, which reads its part of the ARD (or the Study
    Data Tabulation Model, SDTM, or Analysis Data Model, ADaM, data) and
    writes the report as a Rich Text Format (RTF) file with 'rtfreporter'.
    Official runs keep each program's log, what it made and the code it ran
    in a dated folder. Defaults and code lists come from a company's
    standards workbook.
